msgctxt "EVE jargon"
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Reason"

#: models.py:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reason to enter with the payment in game. Field names in braces are replaced"
" by their values, e.g. {corp_id}/{month}/{year}; a format may follow a "
"colon, as in {month:02d}. Use the exact form the receiving app matches "
"payments against."
msgstr ""
"游戏内付款时填写的 Reason。花括号中的字段名会被替换为其值，例如 {corp_id}/{month}/{year}；冒号后可跟格式，如 "
"{month:02d}。请使用接收方应用匹配付款时所用的确切格式。"

#: models.py:114 models.py:202 templates/eos_invoices/admin.html:81
#: templates/eos_invoices/index.html:76 templates/eos_invoices/log.html:50
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: models.py:118
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What a row is for, shown next to the amount. Same placeholders as the "
"reason, e.g. {month:02d}/{year}"
msgstr "该行的用途，显示在金额旁。占位符与 Reason 相同，例如 {month:02d}/{year}"

#: models.py:123
msgid "Date field"
msgstr "日期字段"

#: models.py:127
msgid ""
"Optional date or datetime field, shown in the Date column. Without a Month "
"and Year field, the Description column sorts by it; a source with too many "
"rows for one page keeps its newest ones."
msgstr "可选的日期或日期时间字段，显示在“日期”列中。未设置月份和年份字段时，“描述”列按其排序；来源的行数超过一页时，保留最新的行。"

#: models.py:133
msgid "Month field"
msgstr "月份字段"

#: models.py:137
msgid ""
"Optional integer field (1-12) holding the row's month. Together with the "
"Year field below, hides the Reason while the row is for the month still in "
"progress - the amount owed for it can still change. Both fields are required"
" for this; set alone, this one does nothing."
msgstr ""
"可选的整数字段（1-12），存放该行的月份。与下方的年份字段一起使用时，会在该行所属月份仍在进行中时隐藏 Reason —— "
"因为该月应付金额仍可能变化。需要同时设置两个字段；仅设置此字段不会生效。"

#: models.py:145
msgid "Year field"
msgstr "年份字段"

#: models.py:149
msgid ""
"Optional integer field holding the row's year, e.g. 2026. Used together with"
" the Month field above - a month number alone cannot tell this year's row "
"from the same month a year ago."
msgstr "可选的整数字段，存放该行的年份，例如 2026。需与上方的月份字段配合使用 —— 仅凭月份数字无法区分本年度的行与去年同月的行。"

#: models.py:156 templates/eos_invoices/index.html:47
msgid "Pay to"
msgstr "付款给"

#: models.py:163
msgid ""
